<mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Qual das seguintes opções é a definição de &lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW102593689 BCX8"&gt;"clareza"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW102593689 BCX8"&gt;, conforme&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW102593689 BCX8"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;usada neste capítulo?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</mattext>
</material>
